    "active": "match-anatomy.json and shared-match-anatomy.glb are a 12-joint adapter derived from MPFB exposed anatomy. Runtime creates actual SkinnedMesh geometry from the JSON equivalent. Existing football pose groups drive bones; existing kit UVs and identity remain unchanged.",
